@{
	Layout = "~/Views/Instruction/Shared/_Layout.cshtml";
}

<div class="instruction-content">
	<ul>
		<li>Soccer Share(%): the preset share amount of the "being-viewed" agent on the bet type Soccer - Dead Ball/Handicap.</li>
		<li>
            Turnover: the total amount risked by customer ( i.e. staked or bet by customers)
            <br />
            - Total: the turnover amount which counts stakes of all tickets, regardless of their statuses such as won, lose, draw, void, reject, and refund.
            <br />
            - Actual: the turnover amount which counts stakes of only settled tickets. In addition, ½ stake will be counted for ½ win/loss cases.
        </li>
		<li>Gross Total: the win/loss amount which the "being-viewed" agent recieves from its down-line agents.</li>
        <li>
            Agent name
            <br />
            - Win Loss: the win/loss amount which the "being-viewed" agent can keep according to its share setting in line.
            <br />
            - Comm: the commission amount which the "being-viewed" agent can keep according to its commission rate in line.
            <br />
            - Total: Win Loss + Comm.
        </li>
        <li>Upline Total: the win/loss amount which the "being-viewed" agent gives to his upper agents.</li>
	</ul>
</div>